//RS /// line-buffered loop otherwise (I6: `stty` shell-out, no line-editing
//RS /// crate). The cooked loop is also the exact non-TTY floor `run_transcript`
//RS /// mirrors — piped/redirected sessions keep the pre-redesign plain output.
